# Brolit Shell release signing trust anchor (public key material only).
#
# Copy this file to release/allowed_signers and replace the placeholder line
# with the real release signing principal. The file is packaged into release
# artifacts so verification is self-contained for this open-source repo.
#
# Format (OpenSSH allowed_signers, one entry per line):
#   <principal> <keytype> <base64-key> [<comment>]
#
# Example:
#   brolit-release-2026 ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx release-signing-key-2026
#
# Rules:
# - NEVER commit private keys. Only public key lines belong here.
# - Key rotation is explicit: a release whose bundled key differs from the
#   previously pinned key is rejected. Rotate via /etc/brolit/allowed_signers
#   on the VPS or the BROLIT_RELEASE_ALLOWED_SIGNERS override.
